              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खिड़की (khiṛkī) — \"a window\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of खिड़की (khiṛkī) is not settled, and the derivations offered for it are guesses of varying quality rather than an agreed line."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "This is the second time this book has had to say that about a piece of an ordinary house, and it will not be the last. A word being everywhere is no guarantee that its history was written down."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
